<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Funeral Party</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Welcome to the Neighbourhood</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4673JeKhPaXmXq0J3YIF5F</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.660" end="00:23.760">Watch mud flow down the drain.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.760" end="00:25.980">Until it's gone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.980" end="00:28.560">This party's full of shit.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.560" end="00:32.460">Let's have our own one.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.460" end="00:36.540">I smell a hypocrite, I smell a snake.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.540" end="00:39.540">You're a liar &amp; a cheat, I want my money.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.540" end="00:41.040">I want you dead you fake.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.920" end="00:42.420">Nowhere (is where I'm going)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.550" end="00:49.550">Nowhere (cause I've got nothing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.560" end="00:53.910">Nowhere (let me have something)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.910" end="00:55.410">Nowhere (cause I've got nothing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.810" end="00:56.310">Give me something to do.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.260" end="00:57.930">Give me a job.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.930" end="00:59.550">Give me something to prove.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.550" end="01:01.050">Give me a heart.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.970" end="01:01.470">Give me morality</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.840" end="01:03.600">Give me a soul.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.600" end="01:07.260">Give me cheap alcohol &amp; put me on the dole.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.260" end="01:09.810">Nowhere (is where I'm going)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.810" end="01:17.810">Nowhere (cause I've got nothing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.910" end="01:58.910">Nowhere (let me have something)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.670" end="02:34.670">Nowhere (cause I've got nothing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.560" end="02:54.150">I'm falling &amp; I can't slow down.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.150" end="02:55.650">In a hole with no way out.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.600" end="02:58.600" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Cause I've got nothing)</p></div></body></tt>